# LASAL / SIGMATEK IDE generated or local-state files
# Keep source files (*.st, *.h, *.cpp, *.c), selected project/network files, and docs
# under Git unless they are explicitly classified as generated.
# Do not ignore *.lcp, *.lcb, *.lcn, Network/**/*.st, or ConfigObjects.st.
# .gitignore does not hide files already tracked by Git.
